  "_note": "What the IV Studio cloud image installs. ComfyUI and torch are pinned here; the node packs come from models.json's node_packs (the same list Setup installs on a PC), leaving out the Windows-only ones and those marked \"cloud\": false. torch is the newest CUDA 12.8 build, pinned exactly, because RunPod's and Modal's hosts all run CUDA 12.8 or newer drivers. extraModels are the files only the cloud needs: the 2x upscaler that stands in for DLSS 5, SeedVR2, and one pinned model per picture family (on a PC the person's own files are used). Every cloud model (these and models.json's) is downloaded the first time a render needs it, checked against its sha256 (or the SHA-256 Hugging Face publishes when sha256 is null). required: downloaded at setup. gated (and every models.json file from a repo in gatedRepos): the file is behind a licence on Hugging Face, so it needs the person's Hugging Face token.",
